{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is visible, approach, pick up, move, and place it. Check properties, then perform task. If not, scan area. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = PickUpObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <Action ID = PlaceObject    /> <Action ID = PerformTask    /> <Action ID = ScanArea    />  <Condition ID = IsObjectUnreachable    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    />",
